msgstr "``stormservice-controller`` ：支持 P/D 和 AFD 的多节点编排"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:199
msgid ""
"The manager serves an admission webhook only when one of the controllers "
"for its API group is enabled. ``model-adapter-controller``, ``model-"
"claim-controller`` and ``model-warmup-controller`` enable the ``model`` "
"group; ``stormservice-controller``, ``kv-cache-controller`` and "
"``distributed-inference-controller`` enable the ``orchestration`` group; "
"``pod-autoscaler-controller`` enables both the ``autoscaling`` and "
"``orchestration`` groups, because it reads and scales StormService; "
"``model-route-controller`` enables both the ``model`` and "
"``orchestration`` groups, because it watches ModelAdapter and "
"RayClusterFleet. The Deployment webhook is served regardless of "
"``--controllers``. The manager skips the other webhooks at startup and "
"logs each one."
msgstr ""
"只有当某个 API 组的控制器之一被启用时，管理器才会提供该组的准入 webhook。 "
"``model-adapter-controller`` 、 ``model-claim-controller`` 和 "
"``model-warmup-controller`` 启用 ``model`` 组； ``stormservice-controller`` 、 "
"``kv-cache-controller`` 和 ``distributed-inference-controller`` 启用 "
"``orchestration`` 组； ``pod-autoscaler-controller`` 会读取并扩缩 StormService，"
"因此同时启用 ``autoscaling`` 组和 ``orchestration`` 组； "
"``model-route-controller`` 会监听 ModelAdapter 和 RayClusterFleet，因此同时启用 "
"``model`` 组和 ``orchestration`` 组。无论 ``--controllers`` 如何设置，都会提供 "
"Deployment webhook。管理器会在启动时跳过其余 webhook，并为每个被跳过的 webhook "
"输出一条日志。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the installed webhook configuration still lists a skipped webhook, its"
" ``failurePolicy`` decides what the API server does. Webhooks with "
"``failurePolicy: Ignore`` admit objects without their validation and "
"defaulting. The ModelWarmup webhook uses ``failurePolicy: Fail``, so the "
"API server rejects creating or updating a ModelWarmup while none of the "
"controllers that enable the ``model`` group is enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果已安装的 webhook 配置中仍列出被跳过的 webhook，API 服务器的处理方式由其 "
"``failurePolicy`` 决定。使用 ``failurePolicy: Ignore`` 的 webhook 会放行对象，"
"不进行其校验和默认值设置。ModelWarmup webhook 使用 ``failurePolicy: Fail`` ，"
"因此在启用 ``model`` 组的控制器都未启用时，API 服务器会拒绝创建或更新 ModelWarmup。"

