#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:17
msgid ""
"The current checkout pins Envoy Gateway v1.9.4 with Envoy v1.39.6. This "
"checkout dependency stack requires Kubernetes v1.33 or newer; the `upstream "
"compatibility matrix "
"<https://gateway.envoyproxy.io/news/releases/matrix/>`_ lists Kubernetes "
"v1.33 through v1.36 and Gateway API v1.6.1 for this release line. AIBrix "
"has validated installs and upgrades on Kubernetes v1.34 (installation CI). "
"Older clusters should stay on a released AIBrix bundle until they can move. "
"Feature-specific floors (e.g. AWS DRA / Trainium) may be higher. This is "
"not a claim that every AIBrix workload is certified on every version in "
"that range. Older externally installed Envoy Gateway releases are not "
"validated by this migration."
msgstr ""
"当前检出的代码将 Envoy Gateway 固定为 v1.9.4，将 Envoy 固定为 v1.39.6。该检出依赖技术栈要求 "
"Kubernetes v1.33 或更高版本；`上游兼容性矩阵 "
"<https://gateway.envoyproxy.io/news/releases/matrix/>`_ 列出了该版本系列对应的 "
"Kubernetes v1.33 至 v1.36 和 Gateway API v1.6.1。AIBrix 已在 Kubernetes v1.34"
"（安装 CI）上验证了安装与升级。更旧的集群应继续使用已发布的 AIBrix 版本包，直到可以升级。"
"特定功能的最低版本要求（如 AWS DRA / Trainium）可能更高。这并不表示每个 AIBrix "
"工作负载都在该范围内的每个版本上得到认证。本次迁移不验证外部安装的较旧 Envoy Gateway 版本。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:24
msgid ""
"Release bundles install their own pinned dependencies; these checkout "
"versions do not change an already published release bundle."
msgstr "发布包会安装各自固定版本的依赖；当前检出代码中的版本不会改变已经发布的版本包。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:115
msgid ""
"Check that the Gateway and its policies are accepted for their current "
"``metadata.generation``. Check Envoy's xDS rejection counters and send "
"traffic after restarting a proxy as well as before it: a proxy can keep "
"serving its previous configuration when a newer configuration is rejected. A"
" ready Pod alone does not prove that the new routing configuration works."
msgstr ""
"检查 Gateway 及其策略是否已针对当前的 ``metadata.generation`` 被接受。检查 Envoy 的 xDS "
"拒绝计数器，并在重启代理前后都发送流量：当新配置被拒绝时，代理可能仍在使用旧配置提供服务。仅有就绪的 Pod 并不能证明新的路由配置正常工作。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:99
msgid ""
"When upgrading the gateway from v1.2.8, update the CRDs before the "
"controller, and update the controller before applying policies that use "
"``targetRefs``. Do not apply the full Kustomize dependency onto a Helm-"
"owned Envoy Gateway installation. Keep each controller's existing "
"installation owner. Back up your resources and values first, and review the"
" `upstream upgrade notes <https://gateway.envoyproxy.io/v1.9/install"
"/install-helm/>`_. This migration does not validate every intermediate "
"release or third-party controller that may share the Gateway API CRDs."
msgstr ""
"从 v1.2.8 升级网关时，应先更新 CRD，再更新控制器，最后应用使用 ``targetRefs`` 的策略。不要将完整的 Kustomize "
"依赖应用到由 Helm 管理的 Envoy Gateway 安装上。各控制器应保留原有的安装管理方式。先备份资源和值，并阅读 `上游升级说明 "
"<https://gateway.envoyproxy.io/v1.9/install/install-"
"helm/>`_。本次迁移并未验证每个中间版本，也未验证可能共享 Gateway API CRD 的第三方控制器。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:108
msgid ""
"First render the target CRDs separately and apply them with server-side "
"apply. The example retains the experimental Gateway API channel bundled by "
"Envoy Gateway. If your provider manages these CRDs, coordinate a compatible"
" upgrade with that provider instead of overwriting its resources. If you "
"use the standard channel, review the upstream TCPRoute/UDPRoute API and "
"storage-version migration requirements before upgrading."
msgstr ""
"首先单独渲染目标 CRD，并使用服务端应用。示例保留 Envoy Gateway 捆绑的 Gateway API 实验通道。如果云服务商管理这些 "
"CRD，应与服务商协调兼容升级，而不是覆盖其资源。如果使用标准通道，升级前请阅读上游 TCPRoute/UDPRoute API 和存储版本迁移要求。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:127
msgid ""
"Resolve any field-ownership conflict before continuing; do not blindly "
"force ownership away from another controller. Then choose the matching "
"controller path."
msgstr "继续前请解决所有字段所有权冲突，不要盲目强制夺取其他控制器的所有权。然后选择对应的控制器升级路径。"

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:130
msgid ""
"For a **Helm-owned Envoy Gateway**, keep its actual release name and "
"namespace (the example uses ``eg`` in ``envoy-gateway-system``). Save "
"explicit user values, review them against the new chart, remove stale "
"image-version overrides and retain deployment-specific settings such as "
"scheduling, resource limits and logging. ``--reset-values`` starts from "
"target defaults, then reapplies those reviewed settings rather than "
"retaining old chart defaults:"
msgstr ""
"对于 **由 Helm 管理的 Envoy Gateway**，保留实际的发布名称和命名空间（示例为 ``envoy-gateway-system``"
" 中的 ``eg``）。保存用户显式设置的值，对照新 chart 检查它们，移除过期的镜像版本覆盖，并保留调度、资源限制和日志等部署特定设置"
"。``--reset-values`` 从目标默认值开始，再应用检查后的设置，而不是保留旧 chart 的默认值："

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:148
msgid ""
"For a **Kustomize-owned Envoy Gateway**, after the same CRD-first gate, "
"apply the checkout's dependency and wait for its controller:"
msgstr "对于 **由 Kustomize 管理的 Envoy Gateway**，完成相同的 CRD 优先检查后，应用当前检出代码中的依赖，并等待控制器就绪："

#: ../aibrix-3507/docs/source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:156
msgid ""
"Only after the target controller is available, update AIBrix CRDs and "
"upgrade the AIBrix chart. Preserve your own reviewed AIBrix values, "
"including image repositories, authentication, resource limits and routing "
"customizations, rather than replacing them with an unreviewed copy of "
"``values.yaml``:"
msgstr ""
"只有目标控制器可用后，才能更新 AIBrix CRD 并升级 AIBrix chart。保留经过检查的 AIBrix "
"自定义值，包括镜像仓库、身份验证、资源限制和路由设置，不要用未经检查的 ``values.yaml`` 副本替换它们："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:172
msgid ""
"Do not accept a successful rollout, traffic, or xDS counters until the "
"target images have reconciled. Immediately after the chart upgrade, the "
"previous Deployment revision can still satisfy those checks. Use the Gateway"
" ownership labels to find its proxy Deployment, not a generated name or "
"container position. The example below assumes one proxy Deployment; stop if "
"the selection is empty or ambiguous. Keep the actual controller Deployment "
"name and container name from your existing installation (inspect them "
"first):"
msgstr ""
"目标镜像完成协调前，不得将 rollout 成功、流量成功或 xDS 计数器作为升级验收依据。Helm 升级刚完成时，旧 Deployment "
"修订版仍可能通过这些检查。应通过 Gateway 归属标签查找代理 Deployment，不能依赖生成的名称或容器顺序。以下示例假设只有一个代理 "
"Deployment；选择结果为空或不唯一时必须停止。保留现有安装中实际的控制器 Deployment 名称和容器名称，先检查再设置："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:193
msgid ""
"Use your verified registry/repository references instead when they differ "
"from the defaults above. Independently verify that those artifacts are Envoy"
" v1.39.6 and Gateway v1.9.4 for your platform, and record their expected "
"digests. A version-looking tag alone is not proof. Do not substitute an "
"unavailable mirror tag or bypass this gate. The proxy's named ``envoy`` "
"container must use the Envoy artifact; its named ``shutdown-manager`` "
"container and the actual Gateway controller container must use the Gateway "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"若使用不同的镜像仓库，应替换为已验证的仓库和镜像引用。独立验证这些镜像确实是适用于当前平台的 Envoy v1.39.6 和 Gateway "
"v1.9.4，并记录预期摘要。类似版本号的标签本身不是证据。不得使用尚未发布的镜像标签或绕过此检查。代理中名为 ``envoy`` 的容器必须使用 "
"Envoy 镜像；名为 ``shutdown-manager`` 的容器及实际 Gateway 控制器容器必须使用 Gateway 镜像。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:201
msgid ""
"Run the following in a shell with failure handling enabled. Each target-"
"image wait must succeed before rollout acceptance; a timeout, missing named "
"container, or failed selection must stop the procedure, not fall through to "
"traffic tests:"
msgstr ""
"在启用失败处理的 shell 中运行以下命令。每个目标镜像等待都必须成功，之后才能接受 rollout "
"结果；超时、缺少指定容器或选择失败时必须停止流程，不能继续进行流量测试："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:223
msgid ""
"Before accepting these snapshots, match Pods to the current Deployment and "
"ReplicaSet owner UIDs, including the controller Pods. Require the current "
"Deployment generation to be observed, all desired replicas updated and "
"available, and each current Pod Ready with every required container ready. "
"Check each named container's Pod-spec image and running ``imageID`` against "
"the verified artifact and platform digest recorded above. Ignore terminating"
" old Pods as proof of the new revision. Missing/mismatched image IDs, "
"unready Pods, wrong owners, or incomplete reconciliation mean stop and "
"investigate."
msgstr ""
"接受这些快照前，必须通过当前 Deployment 和 ReplicaSet 的属主 UID 核对 Pod，包括控制器 Pod。Deployment "
"当前代次必须已被观察，所有期望副本必须已更新且可用，每个当前 Pod 必须 Ready，所有必需容器也必须就绪。将每个指定容器的 Pod "
"规格镜像及运行中的 ``imageID`` 与前面验证的镜像及平台摘要比较。不能将正在终止的旧 Pod 作为新修订版的证据。镜像 ID "
"缺失或不匹配、Pod 未就绪、属主错误或协调未完成，都必须停止并调查。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:232
msgid ""
"Record the proxy Pod UIDs, then restart the selected proxy Deployment and "
"repeat the selection, target-image waits, rollout checks, and ready-Pod "
"image-ID checks. Re-select by the same Gateway ownership labels in case "
"reconciliation replaced the Deployment. Require replacement proxy Pod UIDs "
"and verify both named containers again; do not accept a surviving old Pod or"
" reuse an old snapshot. Only after this gate succeeds should post-restart "
"traffic and xDS checks count as migration evidence. These checks do not "
"establish zero-downtime upgrades."
msgstr ""
"记录代理 Pod UID，然后重启选定的代理 Deployment，重复选择、目标镜像等待、rollout 检查及就绪 Pod 镜像 ID "
"检查。协调可能替换 Deployment，因此应按相同的 Gateway 归属标签重新选择。必须确认代理 Pod UID "
"已替换，并再次验证两个指定容器；不能接受仍存活的旧 Pod 或复用旧快照。只有通过此检查后，重启后的流量及 xDS "
"检查才能作为迁移证据。这些检查不能证明升级零停机。"


msgid ""
"Clusters older than Kubernetes v1.33 are unsupported for the new dependency"
" bundle: v1.31 rejects the new CRDs' CEL ``format`` rules during CRD "
"installation, before AIBrix application tests run. Validation on Kubernetes"
" v1.34 does not establish the minimum supported Kubernetes version."
msgstr "低于 Kubernetes v1.33 的集群不支持新的依赖包：v1.31 在安装 CRD 时就会拒绝新 CRD 的 CEL ``format`` 规则，尚未运行 AIBrix 应用测试。在 Kubernetes v1.34 上的验证不能证明最低受支持的 Kubernetes 版本。"

msgid "This procedure validates a forward upgrade only. An in-place downgrade of the bundled Gateway API CRDs is not validated. The target bundle installs the ``safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io`` admission policy, which rejects Gateway API CRDs older than v1.5. Reapplying the old dependency bundle or running Helm rollback is not a complete rollback procedure. Do not delete CRDs to roll back: their resources can be lost. Plan a cluster-admin-owned recovery procedure before upgrading. Rolling back only the controller while retaining the newer CRDs is also not validated here."
msgstr "此流程只验证向前升级，未验证随包提供的 Gateway API CRD 的原地降级。目标依赖包会安装 ``safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io`` 准入策略，拒绝低于 v1.5 的 Gateway API CRD。重新应用旧依赖包或运行 Helm 回滚并不构成完整的回滚流程。不要通过删除 CRD 来回滚，因为其中的资源可能丢失。升级前应制定由集群管理员负责的恢复流程。本文也未验证保留新版 CRD、仅回滚控制器的方案。"

msgid "Between the controller upgrade above and the AIBrix chart upgrade, the new controller already serves xDS to proxies that still run the old Envoy image, and the chart upgrade then rolls each proxy Pod from the old image to the new one. Treat this mixed window as best-effort, not zero-downtime: in-flight requests can see connection resets or timeouts while each proxy restarts. While an old proxy is still in service, sample its xDS rejection counters (the ``*_update_rejected`` stats on its admin endpoint) in addition to the post-upgrade checks below. Rising rejections mean the old proxy is refusing the new controller's configuration: a Ready Pod or passing traffic then proves only the previously accepted configuration, so complete the proxy roll promptly instead of leaving the window open."
msgstr "在上述控制器升级与 AIBrix chart 升级之间，新控制器已经开始向仍在运行旧版 Envoy 镜像的代理下发 xDS，而 chart 升级会把每个代理 Pod 从旧镜像滚动到新镜像。请将此混合版本窗口视为尽力而为，而非零停机：每个代理重启时，进行中的请求可能遇到连接重置或超时。旧代理仍在服役期间，除下方升级后检查外，还应采样其 xDS 拒绝计数器（管理端点上的 ``*_update_rejected`` 统计）。拒绝计数上升意味着旧代理正在拒绝新控制器的配置：此时 Ready 的 Pod 或正常的流量只能证明先前接受的配置，因此应尽快完成代理滚动，不要让该窗口持续敞开。"

msgid "The stable Helm path stays on the released v0.8.0 stack: Envoy Gateway v1.2.8 with Envoy v1.33.2, matching the released AIBrix images pinned in ``stable.yaml`` and ``vke.yaml``. The checkout's default ``values.yaml`` and the Kustomize manifests carry the new Envoy Gateway v1.9.4 / Envoy v1.39.6 stack for the next release; a release that ships AIBrix images qualified behind the new proxy will move these stable pins. To move an existing installation forward, follow the upgrade procedure below instead of mixing the two."
msgstr "stable Helm 路径保持在已发布的 v0.8.0 技术栈上：Envoy Gateway v1.2.8 搭配 Envoy v1.33.2，与 ``stable.yaml`` 和 ``vke.yaml`` 中固定的已发布 AIBrix 镜像一致。本检出的默认 ``values.yaml`` 及 Kustomize 清单为下一个版本携带新的 Envoy Gateway v1.9.4 / Envoy v1.39.6 技术栈；当某个版本发布了已通过新代理验证的 AIBrix 镜像时，这些 stable 固定版本才会随之迁移。要将现有安装升级到新版本，请按照下面的升级流程操作，不要混用两套技术栈。"

msgid "If the old proxy's rejection counters rose during the mixed window, or any check above fails after the roll completes, stop and use the cluster-admin-owned recovery plan from the rollback warning above instead of accepting the upgrade; a successful rollout does not clear persistent rejections."
msgstr "如果旧代理的拒绝计数器在混合版本窗口期间上升，或滚动完成后上述任何检查失败，请停止操作，不要接受此次升级，改用上方回滚警告中由集群管理员负责的恢复方案；成功的 rollout 并不能消除持续存在的拒绝记录。"
